        "TileImage": "$($repository c57ff780-011f-4fbd-89ee-f853d24111cc).Image",
        "Description": "里尔顿隔离 The Realton Quarantine\r关卡目标：\r*先前目标现已变更\r*以健身教练服装，炸死里耶·库珀\r*以健身教练服装，使孙晓丽和孙希楠死于坠亡\r*以健身教练服装，用坠物砸死西蒙内塔·阿尔弗雷迪\r*不得被发现，不得制服任何人且仅健身教练服装可用\rThe Targets:\r*Previous targets are changed now\r*Eliminate Leah Cooper by explosion when you disguise as gym coach\r*Eliminate Sun Xiaoli and Sip-Nam Sun by falling when you disguise as gym coach\r*Eliminate Simonetta Alfredi by falling object when you disguise as gym coach\r*No spotted,pacifications and all disguises except for gym coach are not available now",
        "GameVersion": "8.23.0.0",
